      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kea3",
      "text": "It got so bad that people built them a playground, just to keep them away from the cars.",
      "sfx": [
        [
          "pop",
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gull1",
      "text": "Next, seagulls. They don't just grab any food.",
      "sfx": [
        [
          "seagull",
          1
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gull2",
      "text": "In one experiment, gulls watched a person pick up one of two snacks, and they went straight for the one the human had touched.",
      "sfx": [
        [
          "tiptoe",
          4
        ],
        [
          "pop",
          12
        ],
        [
          "pop",
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gull3",
      "text": "They watch what you eat, and they want that.",
      "sfx": [
        [
          "pop",
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "monkey1",
      "text": "Finally, the monkeys at Uluwatu Temple in Bali.",
      "sfx": [
        [
          "monkey",
          2
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "monkey2",
      "text": "They snatch tourists' phones, glasses and hats, and then they wait.",
